# Deny all direct web access to these maintenance scripts. They are meant to
# be run only from the CLI (php scripts/dump_base_glosses.php, php
# scripts/find_uncategorized.php); today they only fail over HTTP by the
# accident of $argv being undefined under the web SAPI, which is not a real
# protection. Matches the house pattern used in /web/animMIDI/.htaccess.
Order allow,deny
Deny from all
